ubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Market Trading Guide: Astra Microwave among 3 stock recommendations for Thursday]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Indian equities opened higher on positive global cues but surrendered gains amid rising bond yields and hawkish Fed commentary. Smallcaps outperformed as risk appetite improved. Analysts highlighted stock-specific opportunities, including Astra Microwave and Neogen, for Thursday's trading session.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/market-trading-guide-astra-microwave-among-3-stock-recommendations-for-thursday/slideshow/135742034.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135741909,imgsize-13910.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/market-trading-guide-astra-microwave-among-3-stock-recommendations-for-thursday/slideshow/135742034.cms</guid><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 20:44:07 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Fairfax Financial likely to exit IIFL Finance, sources say]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Canada's Fairfax Financial Holdings intends to divest its nearly 11% stake in IIFL Finance soon. The sale aims to raise funds for acquiring a significant stake in IDBI Bank from the Indian government. Fairfax's current share in IIFL Finance is valued at approximately 30 billion rupees, or $320 million. Additionally, Fairfax is attempting to improve its stake in IIFL Capital through an open offer.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/fairfax-financial-likely-to-exit-iifl-finance-sources-say/articleshow/135738516.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135738516,imgsize-.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/fairfax-financial-likely-to-exit-iifl-finance-sources-say/articleshow/135738516.cms</guid><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 18:39:37 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[These 12 midcap stocks rally up to 30% in just one month]]> </title><description><![CDATA[While the Nifty 50 has rallied nearly 11% in a month, several midcap stocks have outperformed the broader index. Here are 12 midcap stocks that have surged between 15% and 30% during this period, according to ACE Equity data.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/these-12-midcap-stocks-rally-up-to-30-in-just-one-month/slideshow/135734690.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135734125,imgsize-18976.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/these-12-midcap-stocks-rally-up-to-30-in-just-one-month/slideshow/135734690.cms</guid><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 16:10:03 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Bajaj Finance to launch share sale worth up to Rs 11,700 cr this week: Report]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Bajaj Finance Ltd. is gearing up for a major share sale aimed at raising an impressive 117 billion rupees. The initiative seeks to draw in institutional investors, with the specifics of the offering currently being finalized. Following the completion of investor roadshows, a qualified institutions placement may take place soon.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/bajaj-finance-said-to-be-set-to-launch-up-to-1-2-billion-share-sale/articleshow/135729545.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135729545,imgsize-49228.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/bajaj-finance-said-to-be-set-to-launch-up-to-1-2-billion-share-sale/articleshow/135729545.cms</guid><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 13:06:59 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Positive Breakout: These 5 stocks rose above their 200 DMAs]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Six Nifty 500 stocks gained over 2% and crossed above their respective 200-day moving averages on November 9, according to